%%languages chinese, pinyin, english
%%title 米店 (Rice Shop)
%%artist 张玮玮 (Zhang Weiwei)
%%youtube 0AUDrbvgx-Y
%%transpose +1

[C]三月的烟雨飘|san yue de yan yu piao|In the south, March mist and[Em]摇的南方|yao de nan fang|rain drift and sway
你坐|ni zuo|You sit[Am7]在你空空的|zai ni kong kong de|there in your empty[G6]米店|mi dian|rice shop
你|ni|You[Fmaj7]一手拿著苹果一手|yi shou na zhe ping guo yi shou|hold an apple in one hand, fate[Am/E]拿著命运|na zhe ming yun|in the other
[D6]寻找你自己的|xun zhao ni zi ji de|searching for your own fra-[G]香|xiang|grance

[C]窗外的人们匆|chuang wai de ren men cong|Out past the window, peo-[Em]匆忙忙|cong mang mang|ple rush by
把眼|ba yan|tossing[Am7]光丢在潮湿的|guang diu zai chao shi de|their glances onto the[G6]路上|lu shang|damp road
[Fmaj7]你的舞步划过|ni de wu bu hua guo|Your dancing steps glide[Am/E]空空的房间|kong kong de fang jian|across the empty room
[D6]时光就变成了|shi guang jiu bian cheng le|and time then turns into[G]烟|yan|smoke

爱人,|ai ren|My love, can[C]你可感到明天已|ni ke gan dao ming tian yi|you feel that tomorrow has[Em]经来临|jing lai lin|arrived
码头|ma tou|There at[Am7]上停著我们的|shang ting zhe wo men de|the pier our boat is[G6]船|chuan|moored
[Fmaj7]我会洗干净头发|wo hui xi gan jing tou fa|I will wash my hair clean and[Am/E]爬上桅杆|pa shang wei gan|climb up the mast
撑起|cheng qi|and raise[D6]我们葡萄枝嫩叶般的|wo men pu tao zhi nen ye ban de|our home like grape boughs and tender[G]家|jia|leaves

